WEBVTT

41:00.818 --> 41:03.946
- There have been disturbing reports.
- What kind of reports?

41:04.071 --> 41:05.906
The kind I don't want to believe.

41:07.616 --> 41:10.077
I'm ready. I won't let you down.

41:11.078 --> 41:12.580
You're not going.

41:15.124 --> 41:16.834
You're no ranger, Jon.

41:16.959 --> 41:19.587
- But I'm better than every...
- Better than no one!

41:24.842 --> 41:26.635
Here...

41:26.761 --> 41:28.971
a man gets what he earns,

41:29.096 --> 41:31.182
when he earns it.
